#N canvas 0 0 900 500 10;
#X text 20 20 pong.pd -- playable demo: serialosc (grid I/O) -> pong (game) -> grid (LED translator) -> serialosc (LED out). press x=0 / x=7 columns to move paddles (any press serves) \, x=3|4 + y=0 resets. launch via mlrv-pd/run_pong.sh \, not pd directly (needs -path flags). no audio in this patch -- pure control/LEDs \, so no dac~ and no \; pd dsp 1 needed.;
#X obj 20 200 serialosc 8000 /monome;
#X obj 20 260 grid;
#X obj 300 200 pong 130;
#X obj 20 400 loadbang;
#X obj 300 320 print ponginfo;
#X obj 20 320 print device;
#X obj 420 320 print tilt;
#X connect 4 0 1 0;
#X connect 1 1 3 0;
#X connect 3 0 2 0;
#X connect 2 0 1 1;
#X connect 3 1 5 0;
#X connect 1 0 6 0;
#X connect 1 2 7 0;
